{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WvKFb9gnrj1795325566.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國在APEC峰會提出，支持成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟，但同時選擇在深圳設亞太共同體研究中心。被問到是否反映香港地位有調整，行政會議召集人葉劉淑儀認為，是各自發揮所長。</p><p></p><p>行政會議召集人葉劉淑儀說：「我想我們跟著國家的腳步走，因為我們在科技使用方面，當然科技的創新和使用方面比不上深圳。他們在科研投放的金額等於地區生產總值百分之7，而且很有成果。是各有所長，我想我們不需要爭著做龍頭，應該是各自發揮自己的所長。」</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/37/episode/12711-%E5%B0%88%E8%A8%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E5%8F%AC%E9%9B%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%91%89%E5%8A%89%E6%B7%91%E5%84%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看節目重溫</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:44:08.206106+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:57:34.078296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:37:34.921592+00:00","content_hash":"44a7b191a7a61f81df4dbbd11bbe53260289948ebf480bdac011ce956a9d4078","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:44:08.206106+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}